  "title": "MetOffice Global 10km and UK 2km Deterministic Analysis",
  "description": "A rolling two-year archive of hourly deterministic atmospheric analysis fields from the UK Met Office, covering a global 10 km model and a higher-resolution UK 2 km model. The global model also includes short-range (5-hour) forecast output. Stored in Icechunk (Zarr-based) format for cloud-native multidimensional array access.",
